  <h2>Define support level before design</h2>
  <p>
    A yoga bra, Pilates bra and running bra have different support expectations. If the product is low support, position it honestly for studio, lounge and light training. If the buyer needs high support, the pattern, underband, strap width and fabric recovery must be engineered differently.
  </p>

  <h2>Why matching gym sets convert better</h2>
  <p>
    A single sports bra can sell, but a coordinated gym set gives the customer a complete outfit. Russian boutiques can test sports bras with leggings, biker shorts, tennis skirts, flare pants or capri bottoms to understand which styling direction performs best.
  </p>

  <h2>Private label details to prepare</h2>
  <p>
    Prepare logo files, preferred logo position, inside label content, care label requirements, package type and size range. The clearer the buyer brief, the faster a manufacturer can confirm MOQ, sample cost and production route.
  </p>
